# T4: TIMED arm B (u1) of the paired ABAB on coding prompts, eight users live (audits off): A = c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-best-time-gate (the control: every best lever, the quad blocks, 19,968 blocks), B = c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-best-time-gate-u1 (the same plus QWEN_FAST_TP4_RS_UNIT_MAJOR=1). The pair differs in
# that one flag. Arms alternate A B A B in this one image, each after its own all-four reset. The tests: warmup, one coding stream, concurrent8_steady (the quad mix), eight 32k code users and eight about 120,000-token users (concurrent8_code_128k), eight live at once.
# READ: the [PACKED-PHASE] round times of the eight-user tests, PAIRED per round, never by unpaired medians (check the load average around the run: a busy host skews a timed phase 10 to 20%, so no build, no CI push and no other job beside it),
# the per-seat rate = committed tokens per round per user / round time, and the texts equal between the arms. Expected from the fusion audit: about 4.3 ms less per eight-seat round (256 reduce-scatters, 512 slices and 256 concats become 128 reduce-scatters). Then offline:
# python scripts/ci/speed_window_compare.py <A results> <B results> --users 0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7 --position-keyed --strict-concurrent-prefixes (exit 0 identical). Duration (estimate): 100 min. Soft.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/u1 development window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/u1 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-u1-1 is what B0 builds from the pushed tp4/u1 commit; every later job serves that one image. A commit of a
# file the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-u1-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-best-time-gate-u1
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent8_steady,concurrent8_code_32k,concurrent8_code_128k
